  "what_this_is": "One real-disc trial of bounded, same-count stadium position editing for ESPN NFL 2K5 on PlayStation 2 (SLUS-20919). Five catalogued VIF UNPACK V4_32 position lanes of a single shape were rewritten, the scene was recompressed into the chunk's fixed stored body with a byte-identical 0x20 wrapper, and the result was spliced into a new image through the fixed-allocation ISO9660 writer. Run offline on a copy of the user's own image; no emulator and no hardware were involved."
